---
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
---

<Section
  eyebrow="Booking"
  title="How booking works"
  description="Low-friction scheduling: choose what you need, pick a time, and confirm — with a phone fallback if tech gets in the way."
  class="bg-white"
>
  <ol class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-paper-soft p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-sage">Step 1</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Choose your session</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Pick the massage type that matches your goals for the day.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-paper-soft p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-sage">Step 2</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Select duration + location</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Studio or house call, with transparent pricing before you confirm.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-paper-soft p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-sage">Step 3</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Pick a time online</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Choose an appointment slot that fits your calendar.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-paper-soft p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-sage">Step 4</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Confirm + arrive ready</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Checkout will outline any deposit/card-on-file policy for cancellations.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</Section>
